#: main.cpp:23
msgid "Command to execute."
msgstr "Le^.nh se~ thu+.c hie^.n ."

#: main.cpp:25
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title.\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken. Not recommended!"
msgstr ""
"Mo^.t regular expression match dda^`u dde^` cu+?a so^? . \n"
"Ne^'u ba.n kho^ng muo^'n chi? ddi.nh,  cu+?a so^? dda^`u tie^n \n"
"xua^'t hie^.n se~ bi. cho.n . Kho^ng khuye^'n nghi. !"

#: main.cpp:28
msgid "Hide the window to the tray on startup"
msgstr "A^?n cu+?a so^? va`o khay cu?a startup"

#: main.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Wait until we're told to show the window before\n"
"executing the command"
msgstr ""
"DDo+.i dde^'n khi ba.n ddu+o+.c ba?o se~ hie^?n thi. cu+?a so^? \n"
"tru+o+'c khi thi ha`nh le^.nh"

#: main.cpp:31
msgid "Sets the initial tooltip for the tray icon"
msgstr "DDa(.t tooltip kho+?i ta.o cho icon khay "

#: main.cpp:32
msgid ""
"Keep the tray icon even if the client exits. This option\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified."
msgstr ""
"Giu+~ icon khay cho du` client dda~ to^`n ta.i . Tuy` cho.n na`y \n"
"kho^ng co' hie^.u qua? tru+` khi startonshow  ddu+o+.c chi? ddi.nh ."

#: main.cpp:34
msgid ""
"Quit the client when we're told to hide the window\n"
"has no effect unless startonshow is specified and implies keeprunning."
msgstr ""
"Thoa't client khi chu'ng ta ddu+o+.c ba?o la` a^?n cu+?a so^? \n"
"Kho^ng co' hie^.u qua? tru+` khi  startonshow ddu+o+.c chi? ddi.nh va` cha.y ."

#: main.cpp:45
msgid "Allows any application to be kept in the system tray."
msgstr "Cho phe'p ba^'t ki` chu+o+ng tri`nh na`o ddu+o+.c giu+~ trong khay he^. tho^'ng ."

#: main.cpp:64
msgid "No command or window title specified"
msgstr "Kho^ng le^.nh hay tie^u dde^` cu+?a so^? na`o ddu+o+.c chi? ddi.nh "

